flowchart LR
    C[Clientes / HTTP] --> W[Adapter Inbound Web<br/>Axum]
    W --> PI[Inbound Ports<br/>Commands / Queries]
    PI --> A[Application Services<br/>Orquestração]
    A --> D[Domain<br/>Model + Services + Rules]
    A --> PO[Outbound Ports<br/>Repository traits]
    PO --> P[Adapter Outbound Persistence<br/>SQLx]
    P --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    T1[Domain tests] -.-> D
    T2[Application tests] -.-> A
    T3[Web adapter tests] -.-> W
    T4[Persistence integration tests] -.-> P
    T5[Acceptance / E2E] -.-> W
    T5 -.-> P
    T6[Application context smoke] -.-> A
